    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Lightweight Performance Optimizer provides simple, safe optimizations for small-to-medium WordPress sites:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Simple Page Cache (stores HTML in uploads/lwpopt-cache)</li>\n<li>Image Lazy Load (adds loading=&#8221;lazy&#8221; to images)</li>\n<li>Heartbeat Control (adjust or disable heartbeat)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This plugin is minimal and intended to be privacy-friendly. It stores cache files in the WordPress uploads directory (wp-content/uploads/lwpopt-cache).</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin ZIP via Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Upload Plugin.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Configure settings under Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Performance Optimizer.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed WP.org review issues: removed discouraged functions, proper sanitization, escaping, no WP_CONTENT_DIR, longer prefixes.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Speed up WordPress with simple page caching, lazy loading images, and heartbeat control—lightweight and privacy-friendly.",
    "description": "<p>Lightweight Performance Optimizer provides simple, safe optimizations for small-to-medium WordPress sites:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Simple Page Cache (stores HTML in uploads/lwpopt-cache)</li>\n<li>Image Lazy Load (adds loading=&#8221;lazy&#8221; to images)</li>\n<li>Heartbeat Control (adjust or disable heartbeat)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This plugin is minimal and intended to be privacy-friendly. It stores cache files in the WordPress uploads directory (wp-content/uploads/lwpopt-cache).</p>\n",
